          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP558 - Canyon Creek&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Last one of the night - #14 of 14 - 27 for the trip - so far!  TFTH&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
