          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP558 Canyon Creek

Posted: N55° 22.308 W115° 05.524

GPSr: N55° 22.307 W115° 05.526&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This one was a quick drive-up cap found well marked in a deep hole.  As per the usual with most caps in a deep hole, this one was badly dinged.  There was not much to be made out as far as digits go.  We grabbed our photos and continued on down the road.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
